 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529048 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "c630f8e1-0324-5294-a68b-04d4d6edff9d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529057 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186528390 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529057 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186528485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529057 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186528514 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529057 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186528821 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529057 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186528900 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529057 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529057 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529057 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186528390 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529057 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "d3a6e30f-e49a-55e3-89a2-979eca32e275" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529087 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186529057 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529087 #edb/ref 1069 "q-141165" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529087 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529087 #edb/ref 1071 "An inner product on $V={R}^{3}$ is defined as $⟨x,y⟩=3{x}_{1}{y}_{1}+5{x}_{2}{y}_{2}+{x}_{3}{y}_{3}.$ \nCalculate the norm of the vector $v=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$ under this inner product." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529087 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "01f92ee9-73cd-5c08-adfa-addc2317087e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529087 #edb/ref 1074 "The norm of a vector $v$ with respect to an inner product $⟨\\cdot ,\\cdot ⟩$ is defined as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖v‖=\\sqrt{⟨v,v⟩}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $‖v‖$ using our definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖v‖ & =\\sqrt{⟨v,v⟩} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{3\\cdot (1\\cdot 1)+5\\cdot ((-1)\\cdot (-2))+2\\cdot 2} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{3+5+4} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{12} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529137 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186529048 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529137 #edb/ref 1069 "q-43906" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529137 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529137 #edb/ref 1071 "An inner product on $V={R}^{3}$ is defined as $⟨x,y⟩={x}_{1}{y}_{1}+3{x}_{2}{y}_{2}+2{x}_{3}{y}_{3}.$ \nCalculate the norm of the vector $v=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$ under this inner product." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529137 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "6e2c74ef-5be6-50fe-9eda-c944716ab881" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529137 #edb/ref 1074 "The norm of a vector $v$ with respect to an inner product $⟨\\cdot ,\\cdot ⟩$ is defined as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖v‖=\\sqrt{⟨v,v⟩}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $‖v‖$ using our definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖v‖ & =\\sqrt{⟨v,v⟩} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2\\cdot 2+3\\cdot ((-1)\\cdot (-1))+2\\cdot (3\\cdot 3)} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4+3+18} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{25} \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529143 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186528985 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529143 #edb/ref 1069 "q-97423" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529143 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529143 #edb/ref 1071 "Let $V={R}_{2}[t]$ be the vector space of all polynomials of degree at most $2,$ equipped with the inner product\n\n$$\n⟨x(t),y(t)⟩=x(0)y(0)+x(1)y(1)+x(2)y(2).\n$$\n\nCalculate the norm of the vector $p(t)=3t-2{t}^{2}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529143 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "7e56a686-12c8-5112-a821-3890332df74f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186529143 #edb/ref 1074 "The norm of a vector $p(t)$ with respect to an inner product $⟨\\cdot ,\\cdot ⟩$ is defined as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖p(t)‖=\\sqrt{⟨p(t),p(t)⟩}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $p(t)=3t-2{t}^{2},$ we obtain\n\n$$\np(0)=0,\\,p(1)=1,\\,p(2)=-2.\n$$\n\nComputing $‖p(t)‖$ using our definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖p(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{⟨p(t),p(t)⟩} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{p(0)p(0)+p(1)p(1)+p(2)p(2)} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{[p(0)]^{2}+[p(1)]^{2}+[p(2)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(0)^{2}+(1)^{2}+(-2)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{0+1+4} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
